  "historyNote": "#5791, eff 3-1-94, EXPIRED: 3-1-00 New. #7242, INTERIM, eff 4-27-00, EXPIRED: 8-25-00 New. #7494, eff 5-22-01; ss by #9475, eff 5-22-09; ss by #12340, eff 7-25-17",
